WEBVTT

00:01.330 --> 00:03.460
<b><i>This year too, the village of Origon</i></b>

00:03.540 --> 00:05.960
<b><i>begins to light up with Christmas lights.</i></b>

00:07.210 --> 00:08.840
<b><i>But this year</i></b>

00:08.960 --> 00:11.220
<b><i>feels somewhat melancholic.</i></b>

00:11.550 --> 00:12.840
<b><i>I mean, it's no wonder.</i></b>

00:14.260 --> 00:15.260
<b><i>Because…</i></b>

00:17.180 --> 00:19.010
<b><i>the symbol of happiness</i></b>

00:19.140 --> 00:21.140
<b><i>has vanished.</i></b>

00:23.440 --> 00:25.060
<b>The murder of my mother…</b>

00:25.730 --> 00:27.560
<b>and the arson of the house,</b>

00:28.820 --> 00:31.030
<b>the killing of Ms. Mitsuyama…</b>

00:34.400 --> 00:36.870
<b>I did it all.</b>

00:37.820 --> 00:42.330
<b><i>Eiji didn't tell the police anything else.</i></b>

00:43.000 --> 00:46.460
<b>Of course, the police
didn't just take his word for it.</b>

00:47.250 --> 00:48.290
<b>That day,</b>

00:48.380 --> 00:52.590
<b><i>Maruta had recorded Reiko's confession</i>
<i>with his videocamera.</i></b>

00:53.550 --> 00:55.680
<b><i>The camera itself was destroyed,</i></b>

00:56.130 --> 01:00.470
<b><i>but the tape inside was</i>
<i>miraculously found unburned.</i></b>

01:01.890 --> 01:05.850
<b><i>That footage, along with</i>
<i>his father's desperate defense</i></b>

01:05.940 --> 01:09.400
<b><i>lightened Eiji's sentence somewhat.</i></b>

01:09.770 --> 01:11.400
<b><i>Still, it seems</i></b>

01:11.480 --> 01:14.610
<b><i>he won't be returning</i>
<i>from juvenile detention for a while.</i></b>

01:14.700 --> 01:15.530
<b>Karen!</b>

01:15.610 --> 01:19.580
<b><i>Maruta is now in a heartbreaking</i>
<i>long-distance relationship with Karen.</i></b>

01:20.620 --> 01:23.660
<b>As he gazes at the twinkling stars, he says,</b>

01:23.870 --> 01:27.580
<b><i>〝It's Morse code of love from Karen…〞</i></b>

01:29.710 --> 01:31.550
<b><i>And then…</i></b>

01:31.920 --> 01:34.880
<b><i>As for Migi and Dali…</i></b>

03:07.350 --> 03:11.140
<b>Geez! I can't eat this much!</b>

03:11.310 --> 03:13.480
<b>Come on, you can still eat more, right?</b>

03:13.560 --> 03:15.570
<b>Alright, the next one's ready.</b>

03:16.440 --> 03:19.400
<b>What do you plan to do with me
after making me so fat?</b>

03:21.780 --> 03:25.200
<b>Just look forward to
the Christmas dinner in 10 days!</b>

03:25.330 --> 03:28.790
<b>Aah! You're planning to
make me the main dish!</b>

03:31.670 --> 03:34.330
<b>Help me!</b>

03:47.890 --> 03:49.180
<b>Dali…</b>

03:50.640 --> 03:52.980
<b>Migi. Stop it already, okay?</b>

03:53.060 --> 03:55.020
<b>I'm not going to come out anymore.</b>

03:58.030 --> 03:59.530
<b>You understand, right?</b>

04:02.030 --> 04:06.120
<b>-Those two will surely treat us both we--
-That's what I don't want.</b>

04:06.580 --> 04:08.330
<b>I want that couple</b>

04:08.410 --> 04:10.750
<b>to have no more worries</b>

04:10.830 --> 04:14.080
<b>and to dote on their cute Hitori.</b>

04:14.580 --> 04:17.540
<b>What about your life?</b>

04:17.880 --> 04:20.090
<b>What about your happiness?</b>

04:24.220 --> 04:26.680
<b>Your joy is my happiness.</b>

04:31.850 --> 04:32.890
<b>Well…</b>

04:32.980 --> 04:35.690
<b>I have to catch up on school.</b>

04:36.310 --> 04:37.810
<b>Don't worry.</b>

04:37.900 --> 04:40.900
<b>We'll still be together as one.</b>

04:42.280 --> 04:44.320
<b>I'll live as your shadow.</b>

04:48.410 --> 04:49.240
<b>Now,</b>

04:49.330 --> 04:52.120
<b>what then
is the name of this microorganism?</b>

04:52.410 --> 04:52.910
<b>Here!</b>

04:53.160 --> 04:55.670
<b>Sce-ne-des-mus.</b>

04:55.750 --> 04:56.960
<b>Scenedesmus!</b>

04:57.040 --> 04:58.130
<b>Correct!</b>

04:58.250 --> 04:59.920
<b>-Wow… amazing!
-He's perfect!</b>

05:13.980 --> 05:15.270
<b>So cool…</b>

05:15.350 --> 05:17.600
<b>I wonder if he has wings.</b>

05:17.860 --> 05:19.860
<b>HITORI SONOYAMA
Th-that's a perfect score!</b>

05:19.940 --> 05:21.360
<b>I've never seen that before.</b>

05:21.980 --> 05:24.030
<b>Oh! It's Hitori!</b>

05:24.610 --> 05:28.120
<b>Sonoyama, have you
been training in the mountains?</b>

05:28.280 --> 05:31.410
<b>When you look closely,
Hitori looks like an angel.</b>

05:31.490 --> 05:34.750
<b>You were visiting heaven, right?
That's it, isn't it?</b>

05:35.620 --> 05:37.170
<b>Well, you know…</b>

05:38.630 --> 05:40.840
<b>I need to go to the bathroom!</b>

05:41.130 --> 05:43.010
<b>An angel's droppings!</b>

05:49.680 --> 05:50.760
<b>Hitori…</b>

05:54.310 --> 05:56.890
<b>Why is it always you, Migi?</b>

06:01.230 --> 06:02.650
<b>I see.</b>

06:02.730 --> 06:04.360
<b>So that's what happened…</b>

06:05.070 --> 06:07.030
<b>Don't tell anyone.</b>

06:07.570 --> 06:08.780
<b>I won't tell.</b>

06:10.780 --> 06:11.990
<b>But…</b>

06:12.080 --> 06:15.330
<b>Will you be Hitori forever?</b>

06:26.340 --> 06:27.340
<b>I am…</b>

06:28.010 --> 06:30.760
<b>Dali and I are
together as one.</b>

06:31.220 --> 06:34.850
<b>Whatever we do,
wherever we go, it's the same.</b>

06:35.140 --> 06:37.060
<b>I've always thought so.</b>

06:37.850 --> 06:41.230
<b>But recently, I've started to think
maybe we're different.</b>

06:42.020 --> 06:44.780
<b>I actually don't want to be Hitori, I…</b>

06:47.950 --> 06:50.910
<b>I want us to be Migi and Dali.</b>

06:56.370 --> 06:58.790
<b>But I don't know what Dali wants.</b>

06:59.540 --> 07:01.080
<b>Maybe it's different for him…</b>

07:11.550 --> 07:14.300
<b><i>I will live as Migi's shadow…</i></b>

07:15.470 --> 07:17.020
<b><i>That is</i></b>

07:17.100 --> 07:18.930
<b><i>all I need.</i></b>

07:22.900 --> 07:25.190
<b>♪Joy to the world♪</b>

07:25.270 --> 07:27.530
<b>♪the Lord is come♪</b>

07:27.610 --> 07:32.110
<b>♪Let Earth receive her King♪</b>

07:32.200 --> 07:33.910
<b>Will it come to me too?</b>

07:33.990 --> 07:37.450
<b>♪Let every heart prepare Him room♪</b>

07:37.790 --> 07:39.250
<b>Of course,</b>

07:39.330 --> 07:42.120
<b>because you're
the nicest kid in the world, Hitori.</b>

07:42.580 --> 07:43.920
<b>Really!?</b>

07:46.000 --> 07:47.340
<b>Well,</b>

07:47.420 --> 07:49.460
<b>a lifetime of food,</b>

07:49.590 --> 07:53.430
<b>a long rope, and a giant hammer, and then…</b>

07:53.590 --> 07:55.720
<b>-a hairy--
-Hey now.</b>

07:55.800 --> 07:58.850
<b>Being greedy is the start of a bad boy.</b>

07:58.930 --> 08:00.600
<b>That's right, Hitori.</b>

08:00.680 --> 08:04.350
<b>Santa gives one gift per good child.</b>

08:04.440 --> 08:09.150
<b>Now, how long will Hitori
keep receiving presents, I wonder?</b>

08:09.230 --> 08:10.650
<b>Forever!</b>

08:10.780 --> 08:12.030
<b>Because I'm a good boy.</b>

08:12.150 --> 08:15.120
<b>Oh? Will you be a good boy
even when you grow a beard?</b>

08:15.530 --> 08:16.780
<b>Good boy!</b>

08:17.080 --> 08:20.200
<b>Even if you grow taller than Dad,
still a good boy?</b>

08:20.290 --> 08:21.500
<b>Good boy!</b>

08:21.790 --> 08:24.830
<b>Even if you get a lover,
still a good boy?</b>

08:26.630 --> 08:27.670
<b>Huh, a lover?</b>

08:29.340 --> 08:32.800
<b>Guess Hitori will be Santa Claus next.</b>

08:32.880 --> 08:35.640
<b>Oh, you're such a romanticist.</b>

08:36.180 --> 08:37.510
<b>What do you mean?</b>

08:37.680 --> 08:39.890
<b>Does getting a lover
make you grow a white beard?</b>

08:39.970 --> 08:42.180
<b>Well, who knows.</b>

08:42.310 --> 08:44.060
<b>Hey, what does that mean?</b>

08:44.140 --> 08:49.360
<b>It means there are
many fun things you don't know yet.</b>

08:49.820 --> 08:52.820
<b>There’s so much more to look forward to.</b>

08:55.360 --> 08:56.820
<b>Perfect.</b>

08:57.200 --> 09:02.040
<b>If I pretend to believe in Santa,
I can get presents forever.</b>

09:03.370 --> 09:04.460
<b>Right? Dali.</b>

09:06.460 --> 09:07.420
<b>Guess he's asleep.</b>

09:08.540 --> 09:09.550
<b>Let's…</b>

09:10.920 --> 09:12.670
<b>share the presents.</b>

09:19.760 --> 09:20.600
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

09:23.430 --> 09:25.730
<b><i>Oh, it's my usual spot.</i></b>

09:31.320 --> 09:34.860
<b>I can't believe
I get to see my grandchild's face.</b>

09:35.150 --> 09:37.030
<b>This is happiness.</b>

09:38.030 --> 09:39.780
<b>Ah, come on.</b>

09:42.870 --> 09:44.580
<b><i>Hey… Wait…</i></b>

09:50.340 --> 09:52.250
<b><i>Don't leave me behind.</i></b>

09:56.260 --> 09:57.550
<b><i>A dream…</i></b>

09:58.340 --> 09:59.720
<b><i>That was the worst.</i></b>

10:21.740 --> 10:23.740
<b>The present split?</b>

10:27.750 --> 10:29.580
<b>Good morning, Hitori</b>

10:29.670 --> 10:30.920
<b>Good morning.</b>

10:31.500 --> 10:34.760
<b>Hey, this… You said one per child...</b>

10:34.920 --> 10:36.670
<b>Did Santa make a mistake?</b>

10:39.550 --> 10:42.100
<b>Santa doesn't make mistakes.</b>

10:42.260 --> 10:44.350
<b>Go ahead, open it.</b>

10:44.430 --> 10:47.270
<b>A clay pasta set!</b>

10:47.350 --> 10:48.480
<b>And this is…</b>

10:48.560 --> 10:50.520
<b>An exciting science set?</b>

10:50.980 --> 10:52.860
<b>I see, I see.</b>

10:52.980 --> 10:54.730
<b>It seems this house has</b>

10:54.820 --> 10:57.490
<b>a food-loving creative child,</b>

10:57.650 --> 11:00.450
<b>and an intellectual, sensitive child.</b>

11:01.820 --> 11:04.700
<b>It took us a while
to notice the difference.</b>

11:05.330 --> 11:06.120
<b>Huh?</b>

11:06.540 --> 11:08.210
<b>We'll be waiting downstairs</b>

11:08.290 --> 11:10.500
<b>with seats ready for the both of you.</b>

11:18.760 --> 11:20.050
<b>Dali… Dali!</b>

11:30.310 --> 11:31.310
<b>Dali…</b>

11:32.230 --> 11:34.860
<b>Looks like we really are different.</b>

11:35.650 --> 11:38.610
<b>From now on,
we'll become even more different.</b>

11:39.530 --> 11:44.580
<b>Our likes, dislikes,
even the way we feel…</b>

11:45.160 --> 11:46.030
<b>But…</b>

11:46.410 --> 11:49.450
<b>There are things that don't change.</b>

11:50.160 --> 11:51.920
<b>Like how my happiness</b>

11:52.250 --> 11:54.250
<b>is you happiness…</b>

11:55.880 --> 11:58.880
<b>And your happiness is my happiness.</b>

12:08.890 --> 12:10.310
<b>Hey Sardine,</b>

12:10.390 --> 12:12.190
<b>jumping the gun is a bad boy.</b>

12:12.600 --> 12:14.520
<b>Learn from Fidelité.</b>

12:14.610 --> 12:16.230
<b>She's good at waiting, isn’t she?</b>

12:16.860 --> 12:18.280
<b>Good boy!</b>

13:04.950 --> 13:06.950
<b>Merry Christmas!</b>

13:07.030 --> 13:08.910
<b>‐Merry Christmas!
‐Merry Christmas!</b>

13:10.240 --> 13:11.750
<b>Let’s eat!</b>

13:15.790 --> 13:16.750
<b>Here.</b>

13:18.130 --> 13:19.550
<b>Omelette.</b>

13:19.630 --> 13:21.710
<b>Your favorite, right?</b>

13:23.470 --> 13:24.420
<b>How did you…?</b>

13:24.930 --> 13:27.340
<b>Oh, don't underestimate me.</b>

13:28.510 --> 13:32.890
<b>There was a time when you were alone,</b>

13:32.980 --> 13:34.850
<b>right before Halloween.</b>

13:34.940 --> 13:37.980
<b>That time, you left a lot of food,</b>

13:38.060 --> 13:40.360
<b>but you ate all the omelette, didn’t you?</b>

14:01.210 --> 14:03.880
<b>Hey, what should we call the two of you?</b>

14:04.460 --> 14:07.630
<b>I'm Migi! And his name is-- huh?</b>

14:09.300 --> 14:10.220
<b>…Da… Mi…</b>

14:10.300 --> 14:10.350
<b>there are things that won't change.</b>

14:12.680 --> 14:13.680
<b>Dami!</b>

14:13.850 --> 14:16.190
<b>That’s an edgy name!</b>

14:16.640 --> 14:18.400
<b>No! It’s Da-li!</b>

14:18.520 --> 14:21.060
<b>You're a dummy Dami!</b>

14:21.520 --> 14:22.480
<b>Oh yeah?</b>

14:22.570 --> 14:24.480
<b>Then, you're a midget, Migi!</b>

14:24.860 --> 14:25.990
<b>Dummy Sonoyama!</b>

14:26.570 --> 14:27.860
<b>Midget Sonoyama!</b>

14:27.950 --> 14:30.530
<b>-Dami Sonoyama!
-Midget Sonoyama!</b>

14:30.660 --> 14:32.490
<b>Dami Sonoyama!</b>

14:32.990 --> 14:35.000
<b>Midget... Sonoyama.</b>

16:08.920 --> 16:12.930
<b>MARCH 1993</b>

16:22.690 --> 16:25.270
<b>It's so sweet it's blowing my mind.</b>

16:25.440 --> 16:27.820
<b>Migi! Dali!</b>

16:27.980 --> 16:30.280
<b>Help braid the pie, will you?</b>

16:32.280 --> 16:33.950
<b>-It's gone…
-It's gone…</b>

16:36.200 --> 16:38.990
<b>Migi! Dali!</b>

16:39.120 --> 16:40.620
<b>Migi!</b>

16:41.000 --> 16:42.620
<b>Your mom's calling you.</b>

16:43.250 --> 16:44.210
<b>Migi.</b>

16:44.290 --> 16:46.380
<b>Wait, it's going well right now.</b>

16:47.040 --> 16:49.510
<b>Is that, by any chance, a Japanese tit?</b>

16:49.630 --> 16:51.970
<b>How rude. It's fried chicken!</b>

16:52.340 --> 16:55.970
<b>Really, how long
will you keep playing with pebbles?</b>

16:56.550 --> 16:58.390
<b>We're not kids anymore.</b>

16:58.470 --> 17:00.720
<b>Maruta. You're wrong.</b>

17:01.480 --> 17:04.600
<b>Migi is expressing food
in a multifaceted way.</b>

17:04.690 --> 17:06.190
<b>It's a kind of Cubism.</b>

17:06.650 --> 17:07.940
<b>Typical Dali.</b>

17:08.020 --> 17:10.030
<b>A man who understands my art.</b>

17:10.530 --> 17:12.240
<b>Of course, I get it.</b>

17:13.110 --> 17:15.240
<b>Migi! Dali!</b>

17:15.570 --> 17:16.910
<b>Pie braiding!</b>

17:20.700 --> 17:22.250
<b>What are you guys doing?</b>

17:22.330 --> 17:25.080
<b>Heard there was something unusual to see.</b>

17:25.580 --> 17:27.840
<b>I told you it's not a sideshow.</b>

17:27.920 --> 17:29.250
<b>Well, whatever…</b>

17:29.840 --> 17:31.210
<b>First, the dusting flour.</b>

17:39.430 --> 17:40.680
<b>What's this…</b>

17:41.100 --> 17:42.220
<b>Whoa...</b>

17:43.060 --> 17:44.560
<b>This is, like…</b>

17:44.690 --> 17:45.730
<b>OV</b>

17:49.520 --> 17:52.070
<b>I forgot to preheat the oven!</b>

17:52.150 --> 17:54.320
<b>Thank you, Mitchan!</b>

17:54.400 --> 17:54.950
<b>YOU'RE WELCOME</b>

17:55.030 --> 17:57.030
<b>Mrs... Mitsuyama?</b>

17:57.360 --> 18:00.580
<b>By now they're quite the pair of pen pals.</b>

18:00.700 --> 18:01.410
<b>YEP</b>

18:01.490 --> 18:03.120
<b>That's what it is.</b>

18:03.200 --> 18:05.080
<b>Alright, let's do this, Migi.</b>

18:25.890 --> 18:29.480
<b>Oh no. Now even I'm getting nervous.</b>

18:30.060 --> 18:31.860
<b>Yeah… But…</b>

18:31.940 --> 18:34.230
<b>Right now, the most nervous one is…</b>

18:36.400 --> 18:37.610
<b>Hey, Dali.</b>

18:38.990 --> 18:40.780
<b>Huh?! What are you saying?</b>

18:40.910 --> 18:42.080
<b>Please, Dali!</b>

18:42.580 --> 18:45.080
<b>You're the only one who can unravel it.</b>

18:49.500 --> 18:51.130
<b>Coming!</b>

19:04.810 --> 19:08.020
<b>I really caused you a lot of trouble.</b>

19:09.730 --> 19:11.480
<b>Welcome back, Eiji.</b>

19:11.730 --> 19:12.860
<b>Welcome back.</b>

19:13.020 --> 19:14.190
<b>Welcome back.</b>

19:14.360 --> 19:15.190
<b>Welcome back.</b>

19:15.320 --> 19:16.860
<b>Welcome back, Karen.</b>

19:24.370 --> 19:25.410
<b>Welcome back.</b>

19:30.750 --> 19:33.590
<b>Congratulations on your release.</b>

19:37.420 --> 19:38.050
<b>Hey.</b>

19:38.420 --> 19:40.510
<b>Say something, come on.</b>

19:56.860 --> 19:58.070
<b>Sorry.</b>

19:58.150 --> 19:59.990
<b>I thought you'd gotten a taste for it.</b>

20:00.820 --> 20:02.990
<b>That's why I didn't want to do it.</b>

20:03.370 --> 20:04.450
<b>Though...</b>

20:04.870 --> 20:07.160
<b>-You still look good in it.
-I won't hand over Sally!</b>

20:07.330 --> 20:08.330
<b>You can have her!</b>

20:08.410 --> 20:10.250
<b>She was a good woman.</b>

20:10.330 --> 20:12.790
<b>Though Karen is worlds above her.</b>

20:12.880 --> 20:14.630
<b>Wear it three times a week.</b>

20:16.880 --> 20:20.340
<b>Everyone, hurry up and eat
or the pie will get sulky.</b>

20:27.180 --> 20:28.220
<b>How is it, Eiji?</b>

20:28.430 --> 20:30.020
<b>Our cherry pie?</b>

20:30.730 --> 20:34.020
<b>Turns out,
I might have a sweet tooth after all.</b>

20:36.610 --> 20:39.030
<b>Oh? Want more sugar?</b>

20:39.110 --> 20:40.320
<b>No, no.</b>

20:40.400 --> 20:42.450
<b>That was just a figure of speech.</b>

20:54.210 --> 20:57.290
<b>So, she's dwelling here?</b>

21:01.590 --> 21:02.800
<b>As I thought…</b>

21:03.050 --> 21:05.430
<b>My mother is not here.</b>

21:06.600 --> 21:07.390
<b>Right.</b>

21:11.230 --> 21:13.100
<b>Someday when I die,</b>

21:13.230 --> 21:16.230
<b>if I'm allowed to meet my mother…</b>

21:16.480 --> 21:18.110
<b>I'll tell her then.</b>

21:19.610 --> 21:23.320
<b>That I lived a imperfect yet happy life.</b>

21:27.240 --> 21:29.740
<b>What are you two going to do now?</b>

21:32.330 --> 21:35.420
<b>We have something we want to prove.</b>

21:43.760 --> 21:46.640
<b>Hey, are you really going?</b>

21:46.720 --> 21:49.010
<b>Dear, don't cry.</b>

21:49.260 --> 21:50.970
<b>It's a happy thing.</b>

21:51.310 --> 21:53.980
<b>Having a path we want to follow.</b>

21:56.190 --> 21:59.150
<b>But they won't
have pies in the dormitory, will they?</b>

21:59.270 --> 22:02.070
<b>Even if I send money…</b>

22:02.150 --> 22:02.990
<b>Right,</b>

22:03.070 --> 22:05.950
<b>I'll go every week and bake!</b>

22:06.030 --> 22:07.070
<b>Is there an oven?</b>

22:07.160 --> 22:09.370
<b>Wait, Dear!</b>

22:17.330 --> 22:19.130
<b>Take care of yourself.</b>

22:19.210 --> 22:21.840
<b>If it gets tough,
you can always come back.</b>

22:22.130 --> 22:24.090
<b>I'll send a carrier pigeon…</b>

22:24.340 --> 22:26.130
<b>Keep the window open.</b>

22:26.930 --> 22:29.640
<b>Tell me about the dam situation there.</b>

22:31.510 --> 22:32.560
<b>Well then…</b>

22:34.810 --> 22:37.480
<b>-Take care.
-See you later!</b>

22:49.240 --> 22:51.240
<b>You're quite calm.</b>

22:53.160 --> 22:55.660
<b>Are you really okay not going with him?</b>

22:56.710 --> 22:58.330
<b>Our paths are different.</b>

22:59.370 --> 23:01.040
<b>Dali will study.</b>

23:01.130 --> 23:04.130
<b>I'm an up-and-coming avant-garde artist.</b>

23:04.710 --> 23:06.970
<b>It's not that great, you know.</b>

23:09.510 --> 23:12.550
<b><i>Besides… this is to prove something.</i></b>

23:14.520 --> 23:16.430
<b><i>Our hearts,</i></b>

23:17.680 --> 23:19.390
<b><i>no matter how far apart,</i></b>

23:20.440 --> 23:23.190
<b><i>are always connected.</i></b>

23:35.580 --> 23:40.000
<b>IN MEMORY OF SANO NAMI
THE END</b>
